OL,3,GNEWSANew MHKs sworn into House of Keys
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe Isle of Man's newest 24 MHKs have
OL,6,Fbeen formally sworn in as members of
OL,7,Fthe Manx parliament at a special
OL,8,Fceremony.
OL,10,FNine of the 24 were re-elected to the
OL,11,FHouse of Keys at Thursday's general
OL,12,Felection, while the remaining 15 are
OL,13,Ffirst-time national politicians.
OL,15,FThe swearing-in ceremony took place in
OL,16,Fthe chamber on Tuesday morning,
OL,17,Ffollowed by the election of the new
OL,18,FSpeaker.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
