OL,3,GNEWSANew MHKs sworn into House of Keys
OL,4,
OL,5,FThat role of presiding officer for the
OL,6,FHouse of Keys was filled by David
OL,7,FAshford, who is now one of the longest
OL,8,Fserving MHKS after 10 years in the
OL,9,Fparliament.
